# FPS-FIELD-BARN-WALK: the FIELD_Barn view, still air, then the camera WALKING 10 cm every frame BACK along its heading
# (downhill, away from the barn: walking at a fixed eye height toward the barn goes under the rising field)
# (6 m/s at 60 FPS): a GPU table of the still view, then of the walk. Every position-dependent cache (shadow pages,
# clipmaps, landscape dicing, grass tiles) is exercised the way a person walking the view exercises it.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/FIELD_Barn.desce --gpu-profile
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,170,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,0.03,-1
Дано set 8180000000000004 WindSourceData.Speed 0
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид w0_still the barn view still: field, barn, trees and sky drawn
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Glide -10
Когда frames 240
Когда profile-dump
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Glide 0
Когда frames 60
Тогда-вид w1_walked the view 24 m farther from the barn: the same field, barn, trees and sky, farther, the camera above the grass
